  "bio": "Nestled in the vibrant core of Honolulu's Waikiki, Suitedreamztattoo embodies the spirit of the islands with its masterful tribal and black & gray ink creations. Located at 445 Seaside Ave within the Island Colony hotel, this custom tattoo studio offers an artistic haven for both locals and travelers, available seven days a week from noon to 9 pm for your inking desires. Experience the fusion of tradition and modernity at Suitedreamztattoo, where every design etches your story into the canvas of your skin.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Honolulu, Hawaii, United States"
